# Nova project configuration

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). `project.json` is authored; the schema,
module root and manifest are generated by NovaModuleTools.
Keep `Manifest.GUID` stable and the public definition matching it.
`Manifest.PrivateData.Gerber` declares the plugin marker, API version, minimum
host version and `Repository` object with `Name` and `Uri`. Do not add a duplicate GUID.
Keep the repository display name separate from its absolute, credential-free URI.
The generated default is PSGallery with `https://www.powershellgallery.com/api/v2`.
Replace `Repository.Uri = REPLACE_WITH_REPOSITORY_URI` before remote publishing
or updates; never add credentials to project metadata.

Keep coverage paths aligned with authored sources and validate configuration
with `Get-NovaProjectInfo`, `Invoke-NovaBuild` and both Nova test commands.
Review packaging settings before packaging. Versioning, release and publication
are separate authorized actions, not automatic completion steps.
